{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32574","headline":"送卢使君赴夔州 · 刘驾","name":"送卢使君赴夔州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铙管随征斾，高秋上远巴。\n白波连雾雨，青壁断蒹葭。\n凭几双瞳静，登楼万井斜。\n政成知俗变，当应画轮车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}